                "text": "Contrary to what Speaker Johnson\u00a0said, this looming health care crisis\u2014one of the most significant health care premium hikes in history and historic cuts to Medicaid\u2014needs\u00a0to be fixed\u00a0now. \n\nAccording to the non-partisan @USCBO, if we wait until December instead of acting now to extend healthcare tax credits, 1.5 million more people will go uninsured.\n\n@USCBO also says premiums will increase by 4% if Congress waits to act.",
